== what a reserve buys back ==
health per stack, paid out of the caster's own counter, at the threshold and at the ceiling Takes clamps
skill           status     needs   per stack   spends   restores   health   ceiling
cauterise       swelter        5          90       22        450      360      1980
verdant_mend    verdure       10         100       10       1000      800      1000
wellspring      moisture      20          85       20       1700     1360      1700

== what a detonate gives up ==
the ticks of a damage-over-time, or the extra damage a stat debuff was letting through
